          <div class="max-w-498">
            <p>Made Clear is a UK medical device marketing agency, based in Oxford, working with medtech teams across Europe and the US. We turn clinical evidence into strategy, film, animation, VR and campaigns that cardiologists, cath lab teams, hospital buyers and patients remember.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="height-0-75"></div>
