      <section class="section padding-5">
        <div class="container-small">
          <h2 class="relative">What a medtech marketing agency should do for you</h2>
          <div class="height-1"></div>
          <div class="text-rich-text w-richtext">
            <p>Medical devices are hard to market well. The evidence is complex, the people who use a device are rarely the people who buy it, physicians trust their peers more than any brochure, and every word passes medical, legal and regulatory review. A good medical device marketing agency has to understand the science, the procedure and the audience before it makes anything.</p>
            <p>We're a medtech content agency first: strategy, creative, production and distribution under one roof, with deep roots in interventional cardiology.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="height-2"></div>
          <ol role="list" class="service-steps">
            <li class="border-1 radius-0-25 padding-1-5 m_padding-1-25">
              <p class="text-size-xsmall font-600 text-color-grey-4 service-step-num">01</p>
              <h3>Strategy</h3>
              <div class="height-0-75"></div>
              <p><a href="/services/campaign-strategy">Medical device launch strategy</a>, <a href="/services/content-and-channel-strategy">medtech content strategy</a> and brand positioning, built on audience insight and the clinical evidence.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="border-1 radius-0-25 padding-1-5 m_padding-1-25">
              <p class="text-size-xsmall font-600 text-color-grey-4 service-step-num">02</p>
              <h3>Creative</h3>
              <div class="height-0-75"></div>
              <p><a href="/services/campaign-creative-and-concepts">Campaign ideas</a> that make clinical audiences stop and remember, and <a href="/services/congress-and-event-creative">congress stands</a> that give physicians a reason to visit.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="border-1 radius-0-25 padding-1-5 m_padding-1-25">
              <p class="text-size-xsmall font-600 text-color-grey-4 service-step-num">03</p>
              <h3>Production</h3>
              <div class="height-0-75"></div>
              <p><a href="/services/medical-film-and-documentary">Medical device video production</a>, <a href="/services/animation">mechanism of action animation</a>, <a href="/services/vr-experiences">VR</a>, <a href="/services/kol-content">KOL content</a>, <a href="/services/live-cases">live cases</a> and <a href="/services/on-site-congress-and-event-production">congress filming</a>.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="border-1 radius-0-25 padding-1-5 m_padding-1-25">
              <p class="text-size-xsmall font-600 text-color-grey-4 service-step-num">04</p>
              <h3>Distribution</h3>
              <div class="height-0-75"></div>
              <p><a href="/services/distribution-strategy-and-channel-planning">Channel planning</a> and <a href="/services/platform-distribution-and-performance">medtech LinkedIn marketing</a> that put your content in front of the clinicians it was made for, and measure what works.</p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section padding-5 bg-cream">
        <div class="container-small">
          <h2 class="relative">How we work</h2>
          <div class="height-1-5"></div>
          <ol role="list" class="mdma-process">
            <li><h3>Understand</h3><p>We start with your evidence, your device and your audience: who uses it, who buys it, who feels the problem, and what each of them needs to believe.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Plan</h3><p>We agree the story, the messages, the formats and the channels, and scope it all in a written statement of work before production starts.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Make</h3><p>Scripts and storyboards are agreed with your medical, legal and regulatory reviewers first. Then we film, animate and build, with KOLs who know the procedure.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Get it seen</h3><p>We cut the work for congresses, sales teams, education platforms and social, plan where it goes, and track what lands.</p></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section padding-5">
        <div class="container">
