        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section padding-5 bg-cream">
        <div class="container-small">
          <h2 class="relative">Why medtech teams choose Made Clear</h2>
          <div class="height-1-5"></div>
          <ul role="list" class="mdma-why">
            <li><strong>Specialists, not generalists.</strong> Our roots are in interventional cardiology, so we already speak the language of the procedure, the evidence and the cath lab.</li>
            <li><strong>A KOL network.</strong> We've filmed and worked with more than {{ kolCount }} key opinion leaders, from interventional cardiologists to structural heart specialists.</li>
            <li><strong>Congress experience.</strong> We've filmed at TCT, ACC, SCAI, EuroPCR, ESC and CIRSE, on the booth and in studios nearby.</li>
            <li><strong>One team, start to finish.</strong> Strategy, creative, production and distribution under one roof, so the idea survives all the way to the clinician.</li>
            <li><strong>Built for review.</strong> Scripts and storyboards are agreed before production, so medical, legal and regulatory review doesn't derail the timeline.</li>
            <li><strong>Award-winning work</strong>, recognised by The Rx Club.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

